  "slug": "golpo",
  "name": "Golpo",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generate AI explainer videos from prompts, scripts, audio files, or documents. Golpo creates animated explainer videos, podcast-to-video content, and script-to-video productions. Supports multiple visual styles (Sketch Classic and Canvas), 44+ languages, various voices, and background music. Auto-downloads rendered MP4 files locally. Perfect for educational content, marketing videos, and social media shorts.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `golpo` (Generate AI videos with Golpo).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install golpo@claude-community` from `Golpo-AI/golpo-claude-skill` (`plugins/golpo`).\n\nGenerate AI explainer videos from prompts, scripts, audio files, or documents. Golpo creates animated explainer videos, podcast-to-video content, and script-to-video productions. Supports multiple visual styles (Sketch Classic and Canvas), 44+ languages, various voices, and background music. Auto-downloads rendered MP4 files locally. Perfect for educational content, marketing videos, and social media shorts.",
